!> Rank-4 version of the vector @ref MPP_CREATE_GROUP_UPDATE_V_
subroutine MPP_CREATE_GROUP_UPDATE_4DV_(group, fieldx, fieldy, domain, flags, gridtype, whalo, ehalo, shalo, nhalo, &
